WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:06.089
It was 1965 and the Chicago PD was investigating
a meatpacking plant reported to be the home

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:10.290
of a devil worshipping cult, complete with
allegations of human sacrifice.

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:13.610
There the cops were met with heavy resistance.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:17.560
A firefight broke out between the police and
the occult worshippers who flooded out of

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:18.980
the plant’s basement.

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:24.500
The cops were pinned down, and in trouble,
but they had a secret weapon - heavily armed,

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.679
decked out in sophisticated ballistic armour,
and covered in strange insignia.

00:00:29.679 --> 00:00:34.860
Mobile Task Force Epsilon-9, also known as
the Fire Eaters, here to assist the cops on

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.410
behalf of the SCP Foundation.

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:42.110
As always with the Foundation, they had no
interest in some mere human cultists.

00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:44.850
Those were a dime a dozen in the world of
anomalous monsters.

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:51.039
What the Foundation had taken an interest
in was who or what these cultists were worshipping.

00:00:51.039 --> 00:00:56.469
It’d all begun a few weeks back, near Danforth
Meatpacking, an abandoned meat packing plant

00:00:56.469 --> 00:00:58.469
just outside of Chicago.

00:00:58.469 --> 00:01:03.530
No one had given the place a thought in decades,
that is until people started going missing.

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:07.620
Rumors spread of people being snatched in
the surrounding woods by figures dressed in

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:08.890
robes.

00:01:08.890 --> 00:01:13.150
Mysterious voices and noises were said to
be coming out from the cavernous belly of

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:14.400
the plant.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:20.810
Some even reported seeing smoke rising out
of the building - thick, black, noxious smoke.

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:23.670
Something was terribly wrong here.

00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:26.350
Something was...anomalous.

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:30.390
The Chicago Police Department Strike Force,
in association with the Fire Eaters from the

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:33.010
Foundation, mobilized at Danforth Meatpacking.

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:37.110
While the police were initially reluctant
to work with these mysterious figures they

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:39.450
turned out to be indispensable for the raid.

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:43.530
There were forty-seven cultists holding out
in the basement of the plant, many of them

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:49.300
heavily armed and all of them hopped up on
zealous devotion to their unknown master.

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:53.610
All except one of the cultists fought to the
death during a tense firefight with Chicago

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:55.810
PD and the Fire Eaters.

00:01:55.810 --> 00:02:00.720
The single survivor was still heavily injured,
and was taken to a secure Foundation facility

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:02.950
for emergency treatment and debriefing.

00:02:02.950 --> 00:02:07.760
Typically, the Foundation would need to perform
extensive tests on the Danforth Meatpacking

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:12.800
plant to discover the source of the anomaly’s
activity, however, this time, it was a Chicago

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:16.080
detective who asked the question that busted
the case wide open:

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:18.000
“The hell’s with the giant pig?”

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:23.020
And while it would turn out to be a whole
lot more than that, there was indeed a giant,

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:27.030
iron furnace shaped like a pig in the center
of the facility.

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:33.680
Measuring 15m by 25m by 20m at its widest
points, the thing was a behemoth.

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:38.560
It had an internal furnace despite no apparent
fuel source, and a five centimeter slot of

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:43.190
unknown purpose on the side of the machine’s
immense, rusted hide.

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:47.870
Naturally, all the police officers involved
in the raid had their memories wiped and restructured.

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:52.490
And they were lucky, because they’d remain
forever ignorant of the true horrors about

00:02:52.490 --> 00:02:56.640
to unfold in the confines of that godforsaken
factory.

00:02:56.640 --> 00:03:01.720
As is standard procedure, the plant was isolated,
and a Foundation research team - led by Lead

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:06.250
Researcher Westrin, under the authority of
Regional Director Caleb - was installed on

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:09.360
the new provisional site to conduct tests.

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:15.070
Other than everyone feeling somewhat uneasy
around it, this new anomaly, dubbed SCP - 4511,

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:20.401
didn’t seem to exhibit any strange activity
save for its perpetually burning fire, but

00:03:20.401 --> 00:03:25.550
during the initial research period, a small,
white card suddenly popped out of the slot

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:28.560
in SCP - 4511’s side.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:32.320
A researcher carefully approached and looked
at the card, there was writing.

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:37.500
It said, “CURRENT DEMAND: A flock of my
own.

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:38.960
- SATISFIED.”

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:42.290
Though nobody on the team had any idea what
this meant.

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:46.660
After going through a shoot out with a considerable
death toll to get to it, having a giant metal

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:50.480
pig shaped furnace spit out a cryptic card
was strange.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:55.220
But at the secret medical facility where the
surviving cultist was being held, things were

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:58.020
about to get a whole lot stranger.

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:02.599
As he lay in a bed suffering from his injuries,
he pulled one of the medical staff close and

00:04:02.599 --> 00:04:08.360
uttered cryptic, dying words: “Give it whatever
it demands, or your suffering will be beyond

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:09.360
measure.”

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:14.480
He expired seconds later, less than 72 hours
after the raid.

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:19.260
Back at the meat packing plant, at the exact
same time, another white card was produced

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:25.850
by the machine, reading “CURRENT DEMAND:
The metal teeth that endlessly churn.

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:28.490
PERIOD: One Week.”

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:31.900
Perhaps this entity was a little more intelligent
than they thought.

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:37.050
A number of researchers on the team, invigorated
by this new development, were eager to press

00:04:37.050 --> 00:04:38.990
forward with experiments.

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:43.270
Lead Researcher Westrin, however, did not
share their enthusiasm.

00:04:43.270 --> 00:04:47.520
Something about this entire situation felt
like a grim omen to him.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:53.130
This entity had a plan far beyond their understanding
- and on some deep, animal level, he knew

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:59.050
that helping this thing see its plans through
would lead to disastrous results.

00:04:59.050 --> 00:05:02.850
On this first gut impulse, he denied the request
for further experiments.

00:05:02.850 --> 00:05:06.210
But Regional Director Caleb had other ideas.

00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:11.139
Caleb overruled Westrin’s command, and the
experiments began shortly after.

00:05:11.139 --> 00:05:17.030
The entity, jokingly nicknamed The Swine God
by researchers, had made its demand: The metal

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:19.020
teeth that endlessly churn.

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:20.250
But what could that mean?

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:25.500
It wasn’t long before the entity began to
produce more cards, each with their own strange

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:27.190
and esoteric demands.

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:33.680
However, on some instinctual level, the researchers
at the site understood the demands perfectly.

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:38.030
The next card’s demand was "The metal of
this suffocating prison."

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:43.480
Upon receiving this demand, researchers collected
scrap metal from around the new site, and

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:47.760
tossed them into the furnace beyond the Swine
God’s jaws one by one.

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:50.770
Inside, they heard the sound of metal crunching.

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:56.180
Hours later, all the other metal in the site
began to rapidly oxidize and rust - though

00:05:56.180 --> 00:06:00.120
SCP-4511 itself remained unaffected.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:06.740
The card that came after delivered another
simple request: "Oil to slicken my frozen

00:06:06.740 --> 00:06:07.900
joints."

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:12.270
The researchers understood and procured three
large barrels of oil and tossed them into

00:06:12.270 --> 00:06:13.449
the furnace.

00:06:13.449 --> 00:06:19.120
The entity let out a deep gurgle, before shaking
violently and expelling excess oil, rusted

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:22.340
metal, and two domesticated pig femurs.

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:27.180
It turns out that the Swine God had an appetite
for pigs, as the next card that rumbled out

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:34.889
of the machine bore the request, “Two of
my children, made in my image, made in flesh."

00:06:34.889 --> 00:06:39.389
In response, the researchers provided the
entity with two adult pigs.

00:06:39.389 --> 00:06:43.980
Just like the previous requests, they too
were tossed into the fiery depths of the giant

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:50.410
pig’s mouth, from which came the horrible
sounds of pigs squealing, and then a low,

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:51.470
guttural gurgling.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:56.860
Next, the request was, “The hooks used to
hang my children's corpses."

00:06:56.860 --> 00:07:01.520
To satisfy this request the researchers provided
seventeen meat hooks.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:07.240
In response, 4511 spat out a metal sphere
at an extremely high velocity, killing observing

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:09.110
Foundation Agent McHenry.

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:13.230
For reasons that weren’t apparent at the
time, rather than giving Agent McHenry a proper

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:17.520
burial, his body was also fed into the hungry
machine.

00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:21.730
Lead Researcher Westrin’s concerns were
mounting, but that didn’t amount to much

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:22.730
now.

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:28.790
4511 had developed a taste for flesh, and
the researchers were all too eager to obey

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:30.090
its command.

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:32.380
On the Swine God’s order, it was fed a German
shepherd.

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:35.720
An hour later, the entity spat out some teeth.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:39.250
Six of which came from a dog, and one from
a human.

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:44.280
More than once, it released a card with the
blunt request “A worker for the line.”

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:49.460
The researchers knew exactly what this meant:
It required a human sacrifice.

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:53.440
SCP-4511 was given two D-Class personnel.

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:57.870
One was flung back out seconds later, crunched
and burned to death with several internal

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:59.199
organs missing.

00:07:59.199 --> 00:08:04.180
The other had a more mysterious and altogether
upsetting fate.

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:08.639
The second D-class was heard screaming in
the belly of the furnace for roughly two hours.

00:08:08.639 --> 00:08:12.699
Thirty four minutes later, a strange liquid
was excreted by the machine.

00:08:12.699 --> 00:08:17.320
When the liquid was tested, they found trace
amounts of chemicals like pig urine and motor

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:23.039
oil - but most disturbing of all, human genetic
material that was identical to that of Lead

00:08:23.039 --> 00:08:24.870
Researcher Westrin.

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:29.200
It seemed that the Swine God had finally taken
an interest in him.

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:33.879
After some final requests for large quantities
of coal, and even human children, to fuel

00:08:33.879 --> 00:08:38.699
its fires, it made the request that sent the
whole thing crashing down...

00:08:38.699 --> 00:08:44.809
“The false foreman, delivered to my maw
to prove your faith."

00:08:44.809 --> 00:08:47.809
Lead Researcher Westrin knew what this meant.

00:08:47.809 --> 00:08:49.480
They all did.

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:53.399
The Swine God was demanding him in sacrifice.

00:08:53.399 --> 00:08:57.730
Lead Researcher Westrin tried to shut down
the entire project, but the Swine God was

00:08:57.730 --> 00:08:59.170
faster than him.

00:08:59.170 --> 00:09:03.050
One of his own researchers shot Westrin in
the leg, as the others gathered round and

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:04.899
forcibly restrained him.

00:09:04.899 --> 00:09:09.560
He tried to reason with his subordinates,
but it didn’t do him any good.

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:14.600
The Swine God had crawled into all their minds
and corrupted them - they were His servants

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:17.540
now, and Westrin was doomed.

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:22.800
Despite his protests, the servants forced
him into the mouth of SCP - 4511, and after

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:29.430
a little over four minutes of screaming, Westrin
was devoured just like all the other sacrifices.

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:33.899
Upon receiving news of the horrors unfolding
in the Danforth Meat Packing Plant, Regional

00:09:33.899 --> 00:09:38.350
Director Caleb declared the security of the
site compromised, and sent in Mobile Force

00:09:38.350 --> 00:09:42.230
Epsilon-11, aka the Nine-Tailed Fox.

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:46.360
The four elite MTF soldiers were given the
simple instruction to figure out exactly what

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:51.439
had happened, and to eliminate any potentially
compromised Foundation staff members who’d

00:09:51.439 --> 00:09:53.660
fallen under the Swine God’s power.

00:09:53.660 --> 00:09:58.879
When the team arrived, they realized just
how far gone the whole place was.

00:09:58.879 --> 00:10:03.949
Almost everyone was dead, having been sacrificed
to the machine, and the ones that were left

00:10:03.949 --> 00:10:05.929
were completely insane.

00:10:05.929 --> 00:10:10.379
They attacked the task force, shouting in
their madness about how no matter what the

00:10:10.379 --> 00:10:15.610
Foundation does to them, it would be nothing
compared to what it would do.

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:18.619
It had them all under its rusty, iron foot.

00:10:18.619 --> 00:10:23.230
The team was forced to fend off repeated attacks
from the pig’s devotees, and even found

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:27.230
the powers of the Swine God starting to affect
their own minds.

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:30.910
The beast was more powerful and dangerous
than anyone had imagined.

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:35.569
The trained Foundation researchers and guards
had been transformed into the same cultists

00:10:35.569 --> 00:10:40.800
they’d fought to gain control of the building
by the mind-bending power of the Swine God.

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:45.470
The MTF were forced to retreat and return
with reinforcements to truly clean the place

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:46.509
out.

00:10:46.509 --> 00:10:49.999
Once a slaughterhouse, always a slaughterhouse.

00:10:49.999 --> 00:10:55.529
At this point, Regional Director Caleb took
personal responsibility over the casualties

00:10:55.529 --> 00:10:59.750
since he’d been the one who signed off on
the experiments in the first place.

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:04.500
He gave up his Regional Director rank, and
deemed himself the new Lead Researcher on

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:06.509
the 4511 case.

00:11:06.509 --> 00:11:11.369
Now that he fully understood the scope and
danger of the entity they were dealing with,

00:11:11.369 --> 00:11:16.350
he wanted to lead the charge in discovering
more about the anomaly, and hopefully someday

00:11:16.350 --> 00:11:19.050
negating its deadly effects.

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:23.489
This may sound like a happy ending, in spite
of all the violence, bloodshed, and human

00:11:23.489 --> 00:11:25.749
sacrifice that brought us here.

00:11:25.749 --> 00:11:28.790
But beware of the premature celebration.

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:34.779
Despite investigation, the Swine God retained
no evidence of the objects, animals, and people

00:11:34.779 --> 00:11:36.990
it’d consumed and burned.

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:42.300
Perhaps it’d burnt them down to their very
atoms, if those even still existed.

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:47.199
What we do know is that not long after, after
Lead Researcher Caleb and his subordinates

00:11:47.199 --> 00:11:54.550
installed themselves into the facility, SCP
- 4511 produced one more little, white card.

00:11:54.550 --> 00:11:59.490
It read, “CURRENT DEMAND: A flock of my
own.

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:00.959
- SATISFIED.”

00:12:00.959 --> 00:12:06.029
And if we’ve learned anything today, it’s
that the Swine God gets whatever it demands.

00:12:06.029 --> 00:12:11.679
A brutal truth that Lead Researcher Caleb
is likely to understand much sooner than he

00:12:11.679 --> 00:12:12.679
thought...

00:12:12.679 --> 00:12:15.769
Haven’t had your fill of eldritch horrors
hiding in disused buildings?

00:12:15.769 --> 00:12:23.209
Check out our two parter “SCP - 1730 - What
Happened To Site - 13” and “SCP - 1730

00:12:23.209 --> 00:12:25.019
- Epic Final Battle At Site - 13.”

